    "summary": "From Kenya to New Zealand \ud83c\uddf0\ud83c\uddea\u2708\ufe0f\ud83c\uddf3\ud83c\uddff\n \nAfter several degrees and work stints from different countries, Nick hit a plateau in his life and career. So when he and his wife made the move to New Zealand, he decided to realign his skills and enrolled at MIT not just once but twice. He felt like he was guided by his course to being prepared and well-equipped the moment he stepped out of school. Now he is working as an engineer and has made Aotearoa as his permanent home.\n \n#GraduationWeek\n#AchievementUnlocked\n#GetMoreYourYourFuture",
